在屏幕边缘收成一颗短胶囊，点开就是一块随手可用的玻璃工作台。待办、笔记、录制和常用工具都在里面；数据留在本机，需要时还可同步到飞牛 NAS。

en:
Version {arg1}
Developer: Lando

A short capsule at the screen edge that opens into a ready glass workspace. Tasks, notes, recordings and everyday tools live inside; data stays on this computer, and can sync to fnOS NAS when needed.

