zh:
新增 {arg1}、修改 {arg2}、删除 {arg3}。
删除条目：{arg4}
范围：待办、笔记、链接、指令、剪贴板、录音。密钥和 AI 配置保留。其他配对设备后续同步会接收这些变化。暂停期间的新修改已纳入。执行前会保存可验证、可回退的 NAS 快照；失败时禁止覆盖。

en:
Add {arg1}, change {arg2}, delete {arg3}.
Deleted items: {arg4}
Includes tasks, notes, links, commands, clipboard and recordings. Credentials and AI configuration are preserved. Other paired devices will receive these changes on sync. Changes made while paused are included. A verifiable, reversible NAS snapshot is required before overwriting; failure blocks the overwrite.

zh:
