将替换普通资料及媒体，保留本机密钥、AI Key、布局与设置。恢复前自动保存可恢复快照。{arg3}

en:
Current data: {arg1}
Backup data: {arg2}
Ordinary data and media will be replaced. Local credentials, AI keys, layout and settings will be preserved. A recoverable snapshot is saved first. {arg3}

